  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole small armoured quadruped with flattened blade-edged tail weapon; not isolated tail and not Ankylosaurus club. [\"Position of dorsal osteoderms in original skeletal reconstruction is expressly speculative.\", \"Head shape partly reconstructed; skull depth versus width not established from preserved fragments.\", \"Soft tissue, palette and skin details artistic; no exaggerated giant dinosaur scale.\", \"Tiny distal knobs may represent eighth pair; optional subtle knobs only, do not label them a proven eighth full blade pair.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 1.9, \"basis\": \"Original paper diagnosis 1.8–2.0 m, use midpoint as reconstruction target, not exact measurement.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole small armoured quadruped with flattened blade-edged tail weapon; not isolated tail and not Ankylosaurus club. [\"Position of dorsal osteoderms in original skeletal reconstruction is expressly speculative.\", \"Head shape partly reconstructed; skull depth versus width not established from preserved fragments.\", \"Soft tissue, palette and skin details artistic; no exaggerated giant dinosaur scale.\", \"Tiny distal knobs may represent eighth pair; optional subtle knobs only, do not label them a proven eighth full blade pair.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 1.9, \"basis\": \"Original paper diagnosis 1.8–2.0 m, use midpoint as reconstruction target, not exact measurement.\"}"
  },
